From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mina Her <minacle@live.com>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 15:57:16 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Increase BlurHash component resolution

- Change X and Y components from 4 to 6 in BLURHASH_OPTIONS
- Enhance the visual fidelity of generated media placeholders

Rationale: Increasing the grid density provides a more accurate representation of the original image during loading while keeping the footprint minimal.

diff --git a/app/models/media_attachment.rb b/app/models/media_attachment.rb
index c40587748d..dc54b364e0 100644
--- a/app/models/media_attachment.rb
+++ b/app/models/media_attachment.rb
@@ -65,8 +65,8 @@ class MediaAttachment < ApplicationRecord
   AUDIO_MIME_TYPES             = %w(audio/wave audio/wav audio/x-wav audio/x-pn-wave audio/vnd.wave audio/ogg audio/vorbis audio/mpeg audio/mp3 audio/webm audio/flac audio/aac audio/m4a audio/x-m4a audio/mp4 audio/3gpp video/x-ms-asf).freeze
 
   BLURHASH_OPTIONS = {
-    x_comp: 4,
-    y_comp: 4,
+    x_comp: 6,
+    y_comp: 6,
   }.freeze
 
   IMAGE_STYLES = {
